# ===================================================================
# PRIVATE MATERIALS — never commit, never push.
# Local-only working area for anything that must not become public:
# reviewer correspondence, acceptance notices, manuscript drafts,
# agent/LLM prompts and transcripts, and internal audit notes.
# ===================================================================
.private/

# Paper working area: only paper/public/ is released.
paper/*
!paper/public/
!paper/public/**
paper/private/

# Manuscript sources, rebuttals, and submission bundles anywhere in the tree.
# Generated LaTeX *table fragments* under results/ are reproducibility artifacts
# and stay tracked, so this blocks manuscript-shaped files by name, not *.tex.
/*.tex
**/main.tex
**/supplementary.tex
**/response_to_reviewers.tex
**/consolidated_bundle.tex
**/manuscript_*.tex
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.out
IEEEtai.cls
To-Submit-*/
**/REBUTTAL.md
**/CLAUDE_INSTRUCTIONS.md
**/*_internal_notes.md
**/*_draft.md
AUDIT.md

# Agent/LLM prompts and transcripts
*.prompt
prompts/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Local scratch
scratch/
notebooks/scratch/
